  "contentHtml": "<p>생명체의 구성체제에 대한 글은 아래에 있는데요...</p><p>작년에 했던 개념카드 배열을 조금 업그레이드 해보았습니다.</p><p><br></p><p>4인 한 모둠에&nbsp;개념카드를 제시해주고</p><p>2인은 식물을, 2인은 동물의 구성체제를 배열하게 합니다. </p><p>해당하는 조직, 기관, 세포 등 사진을 칼라풀하게 제공해주면 예쁘게 완성됩니다. </p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/266CF94558D467F622\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"720\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"KakaoTalk_20170324_091740375.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"720\"  id=\"A_266CF94558D467F62201A8\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/24068E4558D467F80E\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"960\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"KakaoTalk_20170324_091740975.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"960\"  id=\"A_24068E4558D467F80EB829\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/226F014558D467FA20\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"720\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"KakaoTalk_20170324_091741720.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"720\"  id=\"A_226F014558D467FA2067B6\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/237CD74558D467FB15\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"960\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"KakaoTalk_20170324_091742397.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"960\"  id=\"A_237CD74558D467FB152ADB\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2302294558D467FC12\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"960\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"KakaoTalk_20170324_091743100.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"960\"  id=\"A_2302294558D467FC12DA2D\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/236C064558D467FD23\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"960\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"KakaoTalk_20170324_091743786.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"960\"  id=\"A_236C064558D467FD23D6FE\"/></p><p><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
